[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3755217273","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114987#issuecomment-3755217273","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114987","id":3755217273,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7f1BF5","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-15T14:44:03Z","updated_at":"2026-01-15T14:44:03Z","body":"There are a few potentially related PRs in beta2 it seems:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114026\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114132\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114175\n\nCC @BastiaanOlij @dsnopek any ideas?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3755217273/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3756918318","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114987#issuecomment-3756918318","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114987","id":3756918318,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7f7gYu","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-15T21:20:31Z","updated_at":"2026-01-15T21:20:31Z","body":"I'll do some testing after I have some breakfast but my gut feeling says this has to do with going to OpenXR 1.1 or removing the version restriction and Meta having something gated behind it.\n\nThat said, if this is true, this is a problem on Metas end that they will have to fix. We can work around it but it's far from ideal.\n\nAnyway it's just a theory atm.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3756918318/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3757227739","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114987#issuecomment-3757227739","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114987","id":3757227739,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7f8r7b","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-15T22:36:28Z","updated_at":"2026-01-15T22:36:28Z","body":"Yup, I was right on the money. It's defo an issue on Metas side. They gated something again and you thus don't run into it until you update your OpenXR headers, which is why all existing applications keep working, and anyone compiling new stuff suddenly runs into issues that likely never appeared during Metas Q/A process. Same bloody issue we had with aim poses the other day.\n\nWork around is changing the following [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/modules/openxr/openxr_api.cpp#L662):\n```\nbool OpenXRAPI::create_instance() {\n\t// Create our OpenXR instance, this will query any registered extension wrappers for extensions we need to enable.\n\n\t// XrResult result = attempt_create_instance(XR_API_VERSION_1_1);\n\tXrResult result = attempt_create_instance(XR_MAKE_VERSION(1, 1, 53));\n\tif (result == XR_ERROR_API_VERSION_UNSUPPORTED) {\n```\n\nI am not happy about that as a fix, esp because it will only be needed temporarily, so I'll discuss with the team if we can come up with a nicer fix for this.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3757227739/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3758263858","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114987#issuecomment-3758263858","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114987","id":3758263858,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gAo4y","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-16T05:37:03Z","updated_at":"2026-01-16T05:37:03Z","body":"So a little bit more info on this. It's actually not the rendering that is going wrong, it is the head tracking that is completely loosing it:\n```\nOpenXR View pose became valid\nOpenXR View pose became invalid\nOpenXR View pose became valid\nOpenXR View pose became invalid\nOpenXR View pose became valid\nOpenXR View pose became invalid\nOpenXR View pose became valid\nOpenXR View pose became invalid\nOpenXR View pose became valid\nOpenXR View pose became invalid\nOpenXR View pose became valid\nOpenXR View pose became invalid\nOpenXR View pose became valid\nOpenXR View pose became invalid\nOpenXR View pose became valid\nOpenXR View pose became invalid\nOpenXR View pose became valid\nOpenXR View pose became invalid\nOpenXR View pose became valid\nOpenXR View pose became invalid\nOpenXR View pose became valid\nOpenXR View pose became invalid\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3758263858/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3779296572","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114987#issuecomment-3779296572","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114987","id":3779296572,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hQ308","user":{"login":"patrykkalinowski","id":7796424,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTY0MjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7796424?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski","html_url":"https://github.com/patrykkalinowski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrykkalinowski/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T16:16:07Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T16:16:07Z","body":"I can confirm it's fixed in 4.6 rc2, where I can manually set OpenXR API version to 1.1.53. Thanks!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3779296572/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3867521624","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114987#issuecomment-3867521624","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114987","id":3867521624,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7mhbJY","user":{"login":"FrostHex","id":126316318,"node_id":"U_kgDOB4dvHg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126316318?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrostHex","html_url":"https://github.com/FrostHex","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrostHex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrostHex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrostHex/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrostHex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrostHex/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrostHex/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrostHex/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrostHex/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrostHex/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-08T16:40:59Z","updated_at":"2026-02-08T16:40:59Z","body":"Thank you so much guys! I'm using quest 2 wired connection for my project. I updated my godot version and tried to solve this flickering problem for several hours including messing up with OculusDebugTool and other xr settings in vain, then I found this page which perfectly solved my problem as well. Thank you so much! 👍","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3867521624/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4145868041","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114987#issuecomment-4145868041","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114987","id":4145868041,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc73HO0J","user":{"login":"Sooparch","id":69817759,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5ODE3NzU5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69817759?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sooparch","html_url":"https://github.com/Sooparch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sooparch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sooparch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sooparch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sooparch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sooparch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sooparch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sooparch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sooparch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"h